        "params": {
          "text": "RLC resonance: f₀ = 5 Hz, ζ = 0.3\nRun 2 s at 1024 Hz; open the time scopes, then Frequency response → Analyze captured impulse.\nObserve the decaying oscillation and resonant peak. Continuous reference: ω₀=2π·5, ζ=0.3, DC gain=1.\nPulse area = 1; inspect input and output separately so the pulse does not hide the response.",
